{"id":"b55c3b5cc4413e57","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-readonceexpr.md","title":"Read-once expression","display":"df-readonceexpr — Read-once expression","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-readonceexpr","aliases":["27-df-readonceexpr"],"display":"df-readonceexpr — Read-once expression","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolexpr]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§10.1 introduction; §10.3 positive-expression convention","source_printed_pages":"448,456","source_pdf_pages":"472,480","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-local-at-most-once-and-constant-extension"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-readonceexpr"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-readonceexpr</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-readonceexpr — Read-once expression"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f3101a1c9df92f67\" href=\"?note=f3101a1c9df92f67\" title=\"27-df-boolexpr\">27-df-boolexpr</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§10.1 introduction; §10.3 positive-expression convention"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"448,456"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"472,480"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-local-at-most-once-and-constant-extension"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\)</span> 及其叶和构造标签取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f3101a1c9df92f67\" href=\"?note=f3101a1c9df92f67\" title=\"27-df-boolexpr\">27-df-boolexpr</a> 的有限语法树定义。叶子的表面记号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1,x_j,\\bar x_j\">\\(0,1,x_j,\\bar x_j\\)</span>；出现次数按语法树计算。</li>\n<li>引入函数族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathrm{occ}_i:\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\to\\mathbb N)_{i\\in[n]}\">\\((\\mathrm{occ}_i:\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\to\\mathbb N)_{i\\in[n]}\\)</span>、正公式子语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PosBoolExpr}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PosBoolExpr}_n\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ReadOnceExpr}_n,\\mathrm{PosReadOnceExpr}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{ReadOnceExpr}_n,\\mathrm{PosReadOnceExpr}_n\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_{n,m}\">\\(E_{n,m}\\)</span> 为下式构造的阶段族（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{occ}_i(0)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\mathrm{occ}_i(1)\\coloneqq0\\quad(i\\in[n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{occ}_i(0)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\mathrm{occ}_i(1)\\coloneqq0\\quad(i\\in[n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{occ}_i(x_j)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;i=j,\\\\0&amp;i\\neq j,\\end{cases}\\qquad\n\\mathrm{occ}_i(\\bar x_j)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;i=j,\\\\0&amp;i\\neq j\\end{cases}\\quad(i,j\\in[n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{occ}_i(x_j)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;i=j,\\\\0&amp;i\\neq j,\\end{cases}\\qquad\n\\mathrm{occ}_i(\\bar x_j)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;i=j,\\\\0&amp;i\\neq j\\end{cases}\\quad(i,j\\in[n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{occ}_i(\\neg\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{occ}_i(\\varphi)\\quad(i\\in[n],\\ \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{occ}_i(\\neg\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{occ}_i(\\varphi)\\quad(i\\in[n],\\ \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{occ}_i(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{occ}_i(\\varphi)+\\mathrm{occ}_i(\\psi)\\quad(i\\in[n],\\ \\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n,\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\wedge,\\vee\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{occ}_i(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{occ}_i(\\varphi)+\\mathrm{occ}_i(\\psi)\\quad(i\\in[n],\\ \\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n,\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\wedge,\\vee\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_{n,0}\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\}\\cup\\{x_j\\mid j\\in[n]\\},\\qquad\nE_{n,m+1}\\coloneqq E_{n,m}\\cup\\{\\varphi\\circ\\psi\\mid\\varphi,\\psi\\in E_{n,m},\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\wedge,\\vee\\}\\}\\quad(m\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_{n,0}\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\}\\cup\\{x_j\\mid j\\in[n]\\},\\qquad\nE_{n,m+1}\\coloneqq E_{n,m}\\cup\\{\\varphi\\circ\\psi\\mid\\varphi,\\psi\\in E_{n,m},\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\wedge,\\vee\\}\\}\\quad(m\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PosBoolExpr}_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}E_{n,m}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PosBoolExpr}_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}E_{n,m}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ReadOnceExpr}_n\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\mid\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(\\mathrm{occ}_i(\\varphi)\\leq1)\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{PosReadOnceExpr}_n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ReadOnceExpr}_n\\cap\\mathrm{PosBoolExpr}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ReadOnceExpr}_n\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\mid\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(\\mathrm{occ}_i(\\varphi)\\leq1)\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{PosReadOnceExpr}_n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ReadOnceExpr}_n\\cap\\mathrm{PosBoolExpr}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原书 §10.1（印刷 p.448／PDF p.472）、§10.3（印刷 p.456／PDF p.480）说明 read-once 与正 read-once 表达式；已核对这些说明。本目录保留“每个给定变量至多一次”并允许常量的保守扩展，适配带虚变量的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>；在实际参与的本质变量上可简化为书中 exactly-once 表示。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{occ}_i\">\\(\\mathrm{occ}_i\\)</span> 是对有限语法树的结构递归，因此良定义；相反，不能对语义等价类递归计数。正、负叶子出现共同计入同一变量，二元运算明确只限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge,\\vee\">\\(\\wedge,\\vee\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolexpr","status":"resolved","id":"f3101a1c9df92f67","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerp