\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{PosReadOnceExpr}_n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ReadOnceExpr}_n\\cap\\mathrm{PosBoolExpr}_n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{occ}_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge,\\vee","display":false}],"bytes":2815,"backlinks":[{"id":"80321c8440894526","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B$；$\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n,\\mathrm{Eval}_n$ 见 [[27-df-boolexpr]]，$\\mathrm{occ}_i$ 见 [[27-df-readonceexpr]]。$m\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\max\\emptyset=0$。下式定义 $\\mathrm{Read}_m(n)$ 与 $\\mathrm{read}(f)$。 $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$。"},{"id":"abdabeb50455fed9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{ReadOnceExpr}_n,\\mathrm{PosReadOnceExpr}_n$ 来自 [[27-df-readonceexpr]]，$\\mathrm{Eval}_n:\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ 来自 [[27-df-boolexpr]]。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-322","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-readonceexpr|df-readonceexpr — Read-once expression]]"},{"id":"abebc662ad42f28a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；$\\mathrm{Eval}_n,\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n,\\mathrm{occ}_i$、$\\mathrm{ReadOnceFunc}_n,\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n$ 见 [[27-df-readonceexpr]]、[[27-df-readoncefunc]]。"}],"outgoing":["f3101a1c9df92f67"]}